<title>USA: TABLE-Hubco Inc Q2 shr $0.53 vs $0.33.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hubco Inc Q2 shr $0.53 vs $0.33.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				 1997		 1996</p>
<p>Shr		   $	0.53	$	0.33</p>
<p>Net			  12,041		7,732</p>
<p>6 MONTHS</p>
<p>Shr		   $	1.03		 0.68</p>
<p>Net			  23,525	     16,049</p>
<p>NOTE: Return on average assets and return on average equity for the second quarter of 1997 were 1.62 percent and 23.65 percent, respectively.</p>
<p>Earnings and returns include non-cash purchase accounting charges totalling $0.05 per share for each quarter on an after-tax basis.</p>
<p>Net interest income for the second quarter of 1997 was $36.21 million, and $70.4 million for the first half.</p>
<p>All prior period amounts and per share data restated to reflect acquisitions completed during 1996 and accounted for as poolings of interst.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
